-- title:
--   A ring homomorphism sends ideal-span membership to the span of the images
-- statement:
--   If a polynomial belongs to the ideal generated by a set, its image under `formalJet` belongs to the ideal generated by the images of that set.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/NumberTheory/PiExponent/Approximation/AdmissibleMatrixGeometry.lean#L41-L44

